# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kiro governance assets are VERSIONED, not ignored.
# `.kiro/steering/zero-idle-constitution.md`, `.kiro/settings/mcp.json`,
# `.kiro/specs/` and `.kiro/hooks/` are first-class build artifacts: the
# constitution and the MCP registry must travel with the code so a fresh clone
# is governed on the first commit. Never add `.kiro/` (or any path inside it)
# to this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.kiro/
!.kiro/**

